###############################################
### 6. CEK PESAN YANG SUDAH ADA DI DATABASE
###############################################

### Lihat pesan terbaru di chat
GET {{baseUrl}}/chats/{{chatId}}/messages?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Lihat statistik pengguna (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Lihat log klasifikasi dashboard (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/classification-logs
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json